---
import SectionHeading from "../SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-14">
  <div class="lg:col-span-12">
    <SectionHeading id="about" title="About" note="Practice" />
  </div>

  <div class="lg:col-span-7">
    <p class="display text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.6rem)] text-ink">
      Most teams don&apos;t need more software. They need the right software.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:col-span-5">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
      <p>
        I&apos;m a full-stack developer. I build <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">business
        web apps</strong> and <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">founder MVPs</strong> —
        software that takes a manual process and makes it run itself.
      </p>
      <p>
        The spreadsheet becomes a real tool. The workflow stops living in someone&apos;s head. The
        MVP finally gets in front of users. I work end to end — shaping the product, building it,
        and shipping it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a
      href="#contact"
      class="link-arrow inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-navy underline-offset-4 hover:underline"
    >
      Let&apos;s talk
      <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M1 7h11M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"></path>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
